OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly and bright start to
OL,6,FWednesday, but soon becoming mild.
OL,7,FCloud will steadily increase into the
OL,8,Fafternoon, although conditions are
OL,9,Fexpected to remain dry. Winds will
OL,10,Fstrengthen through the day, becoming
OL,11,Fwindy by the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWindy, mild and mostly cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight. A few isolated spots of
OL,15,Flight rain are possible, but most
OL,16,Fareas are likely to remain dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
